node_modules

var
dist

# T-5.7b: the datasette image build now runs `uv sync` for the climate-si
# pipeline project (data/climate-si/sources). Keep host-built virtualenvs and
# Python caches out of the build context so a macOS .venv cannot poison the
# in-image sync, and to trim the context.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache

# T-5.7c: the climate-si derived tables are regenerated inside the build from the
# raw per-station CSVs, so keep any locally-built copies (and the intermediate DB)
# out of the build context. The build never reads them — a dirty working tree must
# not inject stale derived data into the image.
data/climate-si/data/climate-si.*.csv
data/climate-si/data/raw/climate-si.db
